/-! # The umbrella index

Root of the `SP1Clean` library: the core (`SP1Clean.Core`, strata 0–6) plus the machine,
Sail-alignment and completeness strata (`Alignment`, `Proofs/Sail`, `Proofs/Completeness`,
`Soundness`). `lake build SP1Clean` is the full build;
`scripts/check_root_index.sh` fails if a module on disk is missing from this closure. -/
